    "title": "A Hidden Pennsylvania Restaurant Serving Soul Food Everyone's Driving For - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Clara Rivers ,\n11 hours ago If you’re planning a trip through Pennsylvania or simply craving soul food worth a special drive, there’s a hidden gem that locals won’t stop talking about. Food from the Soul in Pottstown has earned a devoted following for its authentic, from-scratch cooking and generous portions. This small, family-owned restaurant serves up the kind of comfort food that keeps people coming back from all corners of the state. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
